        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an adventure platformer that will change the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.poster.avif?t=1781574407\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.webm?t=1781574407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.mp4?t=1781574407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore fields of warm grass and wildflowers. glide through the sky with your leaf. elude predating fauna, or make mischief instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merp in Merpworld evokes the feeling of classic Gamegirl Color platformers, but includes modern niceties such as widescreen support, high refresh rate support, and a hi-def, heart-pumping soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/4e79df9bf344467b61804a417fd2d885.webp?t=1781574407\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>CONTENT WARNING: cartoon blood and violence.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/2c8304de29a41c98191031760092a449.webp?t=1781574407\" width=616 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maybell and these collaborators created Merp in Merpworld:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPOSER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@simplycyndi</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER ART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@elliesprites</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COVER ART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lur Noise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/482afbfae23656a1fbc7820d75e5795a.avif?t=1781574407\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an adventure platformer that will change the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.poster.avif?t=1781574407\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.webm?t=1781574407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.mp4?t=1781574407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore fields of warm grass and wildflowers. glide through the sky with your leaf. elude predating fauna, or make mischief instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merp in Merpworld evokes the feeling of classic Gamegirl Color platformers, but includes modern niceties such as widescreen support, high refresh rate support, and a hi-def, heart-pumping soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/4e79df9bf344467b61804a417fd2d885.webp?t=1781574407\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>CONTENT WARNING: cartoon blood and violence.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/2c8304de29a41c98191031760092a449.webp?t=1781574407\" width=616 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >maybell and these collaborators created Merp in Merpworld:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPOSER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@simplycyndi</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER ART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >@elliesprites</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COVER ART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lur Noise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/482afbfae23656a1fbc7820d75e5795a.avif?t=1781574407\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p>",
